<title>USA: Wandel &amp; Goltermann Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>Wandel &amp; Goltermann Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except for per share amounts)</p>
<p>	 Three Months Ended March 31, Six Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>			     1997     1996		1997     1996</p>
<p> Total revenues	14,342   14,496	    29,797   27,959</p>
<p> Net income		 585    1,181	     1,915    1,746</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.11     0.23		0.36     0.34</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	   5,427    5,155	     5,391    5,178</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q2 1997 results reflect a slowdown in capital spending by some U.S. network industry companies.</p>
<p>Full name is Wandel &amp; Goltermann Technologies Inc.</p>
</text>
